## Quick Reference

### Common Commands

```bash
# Check agent status
zeroclaw agent --status

# Run single command
zeroclaw agent -m "What's the weather?"

# List skills
zeroclaw skills list

# List cron jobs
zeroclaw cron list

# View memory
zeroclaw memory recall "what did we discuss"

# Start gateway
zeroclaw gateway

# Run onboarding
zeroclaw onboard
```

### File Locations

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `~/.zeroclaw/config.toml` | Main configuration |
| `~/.zeroclaw/workspace/` | Working directory |
| `~/.zeroclaw/workspace/events/` | Video analysis output |
| `~/.zeroclaw/people/store.json` | Visitor database |
| `~/.zeroclaw/memory.db` | SQLite memory |
| `~/open-skills/skills/` | Skill definitions |
| `~/.zeroclaw/bin/zc` | Video analysis shortcut |

### Troubleshooting

| Problem | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| "Max iterations reached" | Use explicit tool invocation |
| VLM timeout | Check SSH tunnel: `ps aux \| grep ssh` |
| No faces detected | Improve lighting/video quality |
| Permission denied | Copy file to accessible location |
| Skill not loading | Check `open_skills_enabled = true` |

